  "notes": [
    "声明索引仅用于盘点，不是实现或验收证据。",
    "对应公开类型、参数、默认值及真实消费者验收后逐项更新。",
    "表格／进度条及问答继承入口按本章实际承诺另行核对，不把通用回调当专用接口。"
  ],
  "native_adaptations": [
    {
      "native": "AsyncCommandCallback::new",
      "reason": "多形态IntoCommandCallback约束不能给捕获异步闭包推导boxed-future返回类型，显式构造器提供预期签名；Arc直接移入既有执行器，无第二个回调执行层",
      "evidence": [
        "console_io_tutorial::captured_async_callbacks_use_the_same_facade_and_dependency_errors_keep_their_source",
        "artisan_docs_generated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "native": "CommandIo terminal streaming",
      "reason": "沿用write_raw；终端及时写入且不缓存整段历史，Output::default按原行为捕获文本；组件pending在下一次实时写入前按序发出",
      "evidence": [
        "console_io_tutorial::live_binary_emits_before_completion_and_nested_components_keep_order_without_duplication"
      ]
    },
    {
      "native": "ConsoleFormatError::InvalidColor",
      "reason": "合法3／6位HEX及4／8／24bit输出按固定向量；非法HEX字母不复刻PHP hexdec警告后继续取值，返回明确格式错误",
      "evidence": [
        "console_io_tutorial::color_depths_hex_colors_and_hyperlinks_match_the_fixed_formatter_in_independent_processes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "native": "OutputOptions / OutputMessages / OutputVerbosity",
      "reason": "用枚举和独立字段表达消息类型、格式及详细程度，保留字符串／逐条列表的换行区别；默认方法保留，显式参数使用_with；不照搬任意整数位掩码。Silent作为消息选项沿固定输出掩码规则落回Normal，不作为绕过静默的消息级别。 任意字符串迭代器通过write_iter／writeln_iter一次收集条目以兼顾换行统计及单次遍历；不额外复制消息正文。",
      "evidence": [
        "output-style-oracle.json",
        "artisan_docs_generated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "native": "OutputStyle borrowed concrete output",
      "reason": "包装本次Input和Output的借用，get_output返回原始Output；显式替换输入和输出经真实入口验证。上游OutputStyle嵌套包装的计数委托和其他继承接口仍单列待核对，不能据本批十一条入口关闭完整类型。",
      "evidence": [
        "console_io_tutorial::command_io_can_replace_its_input_and_its_real_output_style"
      ]
    },
    "Question uses owned async callbacks and JSON scalar/structured validator results, optional parameter variants, injected AsyncBufRead, UTF-8 full lines and Duration timeouts; real terminal lease restores modes. Choice, tables, progress and other inherited APIs remain separately open.",
    "Choice answers use the established JSON/text model and canonical ordered keys. Display labels are explicit text snapshots through ChoiceLabel, not PHP object identities. Templates accept one answer argument with positions/flags/width/precision and scalar conversion; invalid UTF-8 becomes a sourced InvalidEncoding error. Explicit ConsoleError::from_runtime_source marks console runtime failures while ordinary sources remain retryable. Raw data and href targets retain original bytes.",
    "Named Table styles now resolve through application-owned definitions: table default, table_named, table_with_named_columns, Table named setters, shared references and explicit clones are verified by console_table_definitions. Typed convenience variants remain available; complex cells/sections remain separate.",
    "Table convenience methods accept Into<TableRow> for real heterogeneous separator/data rows. Actual Artisan and HTTP consumers plus 420 fixed-source layouts verify separator ordering and orientation; inherited separator cell options and spans are not counted complete.",
    "TableCellStyle all five methods, TableCell with_style/get_style and nested default separators are real public renderer consumers. Preprocessing and column-major width callbacks, per-physical-line format capture and live separators follow fixed source. Spans and section redraw remain open.",
    "TableCell/Separator full typed options, inherited getters and rowspan/colspan now have source oracles and actual HTTP/Artisan consumers. ConsoleSectionOutput/append_row redraw and other inherited component interfaces remain open."
  ],
